Package: qore-grpc-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-grpc-module-doc
Description: gRPC, Arrow Flight and Salesforce Pub/Sub providers for Qore
 This package provides native Arrow IPC/schema/record-batch bindings and
 source/compiled Qore modules for gRPC, Arrow Flight and Salesforce Pub/Sub.
 Compiler metadata, provider resources and translations are included.

Package: qore-grpc-module-doc
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-grpc-module
Description: documentation and examples for Qore's gRPC modules
 This package contains five HTML API references and interoperability test
 fixtures. Included TLS keys are public test identities, not deployment keys.
